                 ╭ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────╮
                 │                                             │
                 │ q Ctrl+Q          Quit                      │
                 │ Enter             Select / new line         │
                 │ ↑                 Up                        │
                 │ ↓                 Down                      │
                 │ ←                 Left / previous column    │
                 │ →                 Right / next column       │
                 │ PgUp              Page up                   │
                 │ PgDn              Page down                 │
                 │ Home              First row / line start    │
                 │ End               Last row / line end       │
                 │ Backspace         Delete back               │
                 │ Alt+Backspace     Delete a word             │
                 │ Alt+B Alt+←       Previous word             │
                 │ Alt+F Alt+→       Next word                 │
                 │ Shift+←           Select left               │
                 │ Shift+→           Select right              │
                 │ Shift+↑           Select up                 │
                 │ Shift+↓           Select down               │
                 │ Shift+Home        Select to line start      │
                 │ Shift+End         Select to line end        │
                 │                                             │
                 ╰───── ↑↓ scroll · any other key closes ──────╯
